            "id": "files",
            "title": "关键文件",
            "lead": "按精读路线排，不是文件清单；每档说清为什么排这个位置。",
            "html": "### 先读什么、为什么\n\n| 档 | 文件 | 读哪几个方法，其余可以跳过 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **第一优先** | %%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache.py%% | 读 %%RadixKey.match%%（%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache.py:181%%）与 %%RadixKey.child_key%%（%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache.py:217%%）搞清 key 怎么比、字典键是什么；读 %%match_prefix%% 加 %%_match_prefix_helper%%（%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache.py:377%%、%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache.py:679%%）搞清一次命中；读 %%insert%% 加 %%_insert_helper%%（%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache.py:437%%、%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache.py:738%%）搞清节点怎么长；读 %%_split_node%%、%%evict%%、%%inc_lock_ref%%、%%dec_lock_ref%%（%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache.py:705%%、%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache.py:593%%、%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache.py:623%%、%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache.py:638%%）。度量与事件上报、%%pretty_print%%、%%total_size%%、%%all_values_flatten%%、%%reset%%、%%create_simulated%% 可以后读 |\n| **第二优先** | %%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/base_prefix_cache.py%% | 只读 %%MatchResult%% 的字段表（%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/base_prefix_cache.py:184%%）与抽象方法清单（%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/base_prefix_cache.py:318%%）。不看它会把 %%last_device_node%% 与 %%best_match_node%% 当成同一个东西，而主机回载用的是后者 |\n| **第二优先** | %%python/sglang/srt/managers/schedule_policy.py%% | 读 %%match_prefix_for_req%%（%%python/sglang/srt/managers/schedule_policy.py:141%%）与 %%PrefillAdder.add_one_req%% 里设 %%extend_range%% 的两行（%%python/sglang/srt/managers/schedule_policy.py:1140%%、%%python/sglang/srt/managers/schedule_policy.py:1162%%）。树的正确性一半在这里被消费：命中长度怎么变成这次要算多少 token |\n| **第三优先** | %%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache_cpp.py%% 与 %%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/cpp_radix_tree/tree_v2_impl.h%% | 先看 %%RadixCacheCpp%% 构造函数里的拒绝条件（%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache_cpp.py:55%%、%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/radix_cache_cpp.py:88%%），再看 %%tree_walk%% 与 %%split_node%%（%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/cpp_radix_tree/tree_v2_impl.h:83%%、%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/cpp_radix_tree/tree_v2_impl.h:40%%）。两者对照着读，能看出 C++ 版把页对齐放在树内部做 |\n| **第三优先** | %%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/rust_tree_core/adapter.py%% 与 %%rust/mem-cache/README.md%% | 读适配层构造函数里的三段拒绝（%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/rust_tree_core/adapter.py:309%%、%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/rust_tree_core/adapter.py:316%%、%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/rust_tree_core/adapter.py:326%%）与 %%match_prefix%%（%%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/rust_tree_core/adapter.py:578%%）。README 只讲构建与选择方式，不讲算法 |\n| **不建议先读** | %%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/unified_cache/%% | 那是统一树内核的组件模型，与这套 token 级树的算法不是同一件事；只有要改 %%UnifiedTreeCoreInterface%% 的 Rust 后端时才需要 |\n| **不建议先读** | %%python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/memory_pool.py%% | 槽位本体的布局，占了 %%mem_cache/%% 里最大的一份；树只调它的 %%free_segment%%，先把树读完再回来看 |"
