        "files": "python/sglang/srt/model_loader/ 下 23 个 py 共 12325 行。主干是 python/sglang/srt/model_loader/loader.py 4390 行与 python/sglang/srt/model_loader/weight_utils.py 1964 行；CI 专用的 python/sglang/srt/model_loader/ci_weight_validation.py 932 行；专家包工具在 python/sglang/srt/model_loader/expert_pack/ 8 文件 2490 行与 python/sglang/srt/model_loader/expert_pack_runtime.py 593 行；其余为 python/sglang/srt/model_loader/utils.py 357 行、python/sglang/srt/model_loader/expert_pack_loader.py 320 行、python/sglang/srt/model_loader/auto_loader.py 225 行、python/sglang/srt/model_loader/post_load.py 221 行、python/sglang/srt/model_loader/kimi_k3_gguf.py 203 行、python/sglang/srt/model_loader/remote_instance_weight_loader_utils.py 194 行、python/sglang/srt/model_loader/deepseek4_gguf.py 181 行、python/sglang/srt/model_loader/checkpoint_quantization.py 100 行、python/sglang/srt/model_loader/gguf_name_maps.py 72 行、python/sglang/srt/model_loader/expert_pack_config.py 41 行、python/sglang/srt/model_loader/__init__.py 42 行。",
